John, I hope that this week of being able to do whatever you want is-- probably not, because you have kids

00:03:43.160 --> 00:03:45.440
so, you're probably doing whatever they want.

00:03:46.260 --> 00:03:47.300
That sounds like less fun.

00:03:47.300 --> 00:03:50.120
But I'm sure you're enjoying it nonetheless, and I'll see you on Tuesday.

